OL,3,ANo closure for terror victims, says
OL,4,ABurnham, as survivors tell ceremony
OL,5,Aabout life after attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism, for
OL,9,Fwhich a ceremony has taken place in
OL,10,FLondon
OL,12,FPM Andy Burnham tells survivors and
OL,13,Fbereaved families he has a "deep
OL,14,Fadmiration" for them - and acknowledges
OL,15,Fthere's "no closure" for victims
OL,17,FEarlier, Paul Price, a survivor of the
OL,18,F2017 Manchester Arena attack, told the
OL,19,Fevent "I will never be the man I was" -
OL,20,Fadding that part of him died along with
OL,21,Fhis partner, Elaine
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
